    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just about being tired. it's like... i see them struggling with stuff and i realize i can't fix it, and the more i try, the more i just drain the energy out of the house. they'd be so much lighter if they didn't have to worry about me or my moods or my struggles all the time. it just feels like a net negative for them.",
